                <p class="text-white/90 text-base md:text-lg mb-6">For import-export enquiries, contract supply, and shipment planning across domestic and international destinations.</p>
                <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-accent">
                    <span class="h-px w-8 bg-accent"></span>
                    <p class="uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold text-sm">60+ Years in Agro Commodity Trade</p>
                    <span class="h-px w-8 bg-accent"></span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

