                                <a href="https://wa.me/916261605175" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-[#25D366] text-white text-sm font-semibold hover:brightness-95 transition-all">
