                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-secondary text-lg">Business Information</h4>
                                    <p class="text-gray-600">Address: 329/2 Nemawar Road, Palda, <br>Idhyog Nagar, Indore (M.P.)</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
                                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-phone-volume text-accent text-xl"></i>
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <h4 class="font-bold text-secondary text-lg">Phone</h4>
                                    <p class="text-gray-600">+91 6261605175 (Call & WhatsApp)</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm">
